{
  "bookId": "hero-212012",
  "id": "bond-28544",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28544001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "一间房子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28544002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是送给凛的礼物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28544003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28544004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没有别的意思哦，大部分手办都收到过这样的礼物——我不说凛肯定也知道的吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28544005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "谢谢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28544006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "可是为什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28544007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "喜欢你，想送给你礼物，那些聊天也是，希望你快乐，不要总是一个人，就这么简单。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28544008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "喜欢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28544009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没错，像是老父亲对女儿的喜欢，也像是恋人的喜欢，有时候还像是小朋友间的喜欢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28544010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "凛总是不爱说话，你觉得这样很酷吧，可我从来没这么认为。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28544011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "闭路收到了新任务，对不起，要离开了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28544012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "又一次成功避免了煽情的桥段呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28544013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好吧，还能说什么呢，骄傲的小姐，祝你顺利。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28544014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "可以等我吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28544015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯？你说什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28544016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "可以等我吗，做完这次任务，我会很快回来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28544017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "听起来感觉不太……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28544018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "等我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28544019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "那个时候，我也有别的话，要对你说。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
